      "html": "しまなかったも???　なんだろう　文字化け?　Lau777 I think you could use しなかったら to have the meaning if it wasn`t done.<br/><br/>例えば　<br/>もし　生徒たちが勉強しなかったら､　そなに難しい試験が無理だけど...<br/><br/>if the students had not studied, a test this difficult would be impossible but... (of course they studied so no problems)",
